# Lesson 1 ΓÇö Why Spark Exists & How It Thinks

## 1. The problem Spark solves
- Data too big for one machine: 500GB CSV, 16GB RAM laptop. Options: bigger machine (expensive, ceiling), or split across machines (distributed).
